+Renting Your Home or Condo in Myrtle Beach
+Hello, I’m Mike Childs, and I’d like to “thank you” for your interest in renting your Myrtle Beach area home or condo.
+Renting your home or condo or even your commercial property can be a very rewarding, and profitable experience when you work with a dedicated property manager who puts your best interests first and foremost.
+You already know that YOU are the most important person in the local rental market. Without you there would be no opportunity for many deserving individuals and families to have quality housing. No opportunities for small businesses to establish themselves and grow. Because you are the most important person in the rental market your deserve the very best property management services available.
+And that’s my promise to you. I’ll provide you the best real estate asset management services available in this area.
+I’ll work hard for you and only you. Your best interests will be my only concern.
+I’ll help you preserve your property’s value. I’ll help acquire the best possible tenants. And when problems arise, I’ll deal with them effectively and efficiently. I’ll take the headaches and hassles out of renting and maintaining your myrtle beach property and I’ll save you time and money.
+So make sure you receive only the best property management service available. Connect with me whenever you’re considering renting your Myrtle Beach home, condo or commercial property.
+Our Personal Flat Fee Service Includes …
+Monthly Fees as low as 7% – $150.00 Per Month minimum*.
+Biannual Inspections
+Monthly Accounting
+State Approved Trust Account For All Funds
+Electronic Rent Payments & Transfers
+Oversee Maintenance, Repairs, and Replacements.
+Prompt Attention To and Resolution of Any Issues or Problems
+Tenant Placement and Evictions No Placement Fee
+No Eviction Fee, Except Required Serving and Court Costs
+Application Process Interviews
+SC and U.S. Criminal Background Checks
+Credit Reports
+Eviction reports
+Employment and salary verification
+Pet interview and registration of breed, vaccinations, photo, size, & number
+*A & B Class Properties Only (Applies to Homes, Condos, & Mobile Homes)
+A: Newer homes in nice neighborhoods
+B: Older but well maintained homes in nice neighborhoods
+C: Older homes with some deferred maintenance, but generally in good condition.
+D: Much older homes with too much deferred maintenance in undesirable locations.
+F: Very old homes with serious maintenance issues in blighted locations.
+Connect With Mike
+Childs Real Estate LLC is an independent family owned real estate brokerage and property management company in Myrtle Beach South Carolina.
+Our business philosophy is simple. "You are the most important person in any real estate transaction". Without you, the buyer or seller, we would not be in business. We always put your unique needs and goals first & foremost, and always represent "your" best interests in every transaction.
+We guarantee our performance and your satisfaction!
