+<div class="wp-block-stackable-text stk-block-text stk-block stk-f9a98c0" data-block-id="f9a98c0"><p class="stk-block-text__text">Our company has a bed bug remediation program. For a flat monthly fee charged to your account, we’ll inspect and remediate an infected unit. All units are inspected by a certified canine 2 times per year and certified bed bug free at the time of inspection. Many times we can identify the problem and remediate before a guest experiences an issue. This saves rental revenue, avoids negative reviews and is the most cost effective means of treatment.</p></div>
