+</div>
+<div class="row">
+<div class="col-12 col-sm-6 col-md-6"><img loading="lazy" src="https://seasidevacations.icnd-cdn.com/userfiles/renovation-tools-for-building-a-home-1-pqni52fb-20191119-141450-2EE6689D-874F-43FA-B9A1B4963E0A516E.jpg" alt="Property Maintenance" data-filename="renovation-tools-for-building-a-home-1-pqnI52fB-20191119-141450.jpg"></div>
+<div class="col-12 col-sm-6 col-md-6 flex justify-center flex-col items-center">
+<p><span class="font-semibold">Maintenance&nbsp;</span></p>
+<p>No matter how new the property, maintenance issues will arise. For those who have warranties, we will assist you to the best of our ability in contacting the appropriate person(s) to make repairs to your property.
+No matter how new the property, maintenance issues will arise. </p>
+</div>
+</div>
+<div class="row">
+<div class="col-12 col-sm-6 col-md-12">
+<p>For those who have warranties, we will assist you to the best of our ability in contacting the appropriate person(s) to make repairs to your property. Here at Seaside Vacations, we go above and beyond to handle all maintenance issues with great care and sensitivity.
+</p>
+<p> We do not want our homeowners "nickel and dimed" to death! Each owner has different needs one maintenance program is not a perfect fit for everyone. We offer our homeowners two different options for maintenance. Option 1 is basically a "pay per call" way to handle maintenance issues. In other words, if Seaside has to go to your property for a toilet that will not stop running, the owner will pay for the parts to make the repair as well as a $35 service call. The 2026 Option 2 maintenance plan is $275 annually and offers unlimited service calls, where the homeowner is only charged for parts and not the $35 service call every time we go to the unit to make a repair.
+</p>
+<p> We will gladly use any vendor you choose for repairs that require professionals such as AC, plumbing, electrical, etc. If you do not have a preference, we will use our vendor of choice.</p>
+<p><br></p>
+</div>
