+<div class="col-12 col-sm-6 col-md-6 flex justify-center flex-col items-center">
+<p><span class="font-semibold">Marketing</span>&nbsp;</p>
+<p>We make money when you make money….period. An empty property benefits no one. The Seaside Team recognizes and responds to changes in the vacation rental industry on a continuous basis. For years Seaside has worked diligently to brand our name in the rental market.</p>
+</div>
+</div>
+<div class="row">
+<div class="col-12 col-sm-6 col-md-12">
+<p>A state of the art website, premiere website hosting, direct mail, and rack card distribution are only a portion of our integrated marketing program.
+</p>
+<p>
+We are committed to driving traffic to our website through organic SEO practices, PPC campaigns, email blasts, blogs, and social media. Seaside Marketing department utilizes independent search engine tools such as Active Search Results to gain higher rankings in Google and other top search engines.
+</p>
+<p>
+All of our print materials, such as brochures, magazine and newspaper ads, direct mail pieces, and so forth are all provided at no additional cost to our owners.</p>
