+            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-body-text field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><h4>Accommodations are subject to:&nbsp;</h4><ul><li>5% Sales Tax​</li><li>2% Accommodations Tax</li><li>Any local Sales &amp; Use Tax that is collected on behalf of counties by the SCDOR.​</li></ul><p>​South Carolina Accommodations tax rates by Municipality ​​​​(<a href="/sites/dor/files/forms/ST575.pdf"><strong>ST-575</strong></a>)​<br>South Carolina Municipality codes (<a href="/sites/dor/files/forms/ST-604.pdf"><strong>ST-604</strong></a>)</p><p><a href="/sites/dor/files/Documents/Flyers%20%2B%20Brochures/Accommodations_Flyer.pdf"><strong>Check out our helpful chart</strong></a> if you still​ aren't sure if you need to pay Accommodations Tax.</p></div>
