+<p class="faqs-heading">Who needs a business license?</p>
+<div class="faqs-toggle-content" style="display: none;"><p><p>Every person, firm, corporation, or other legal entity engaged in business or maintaining an office, or acting as an agent within the city limits of Myrtle Beach must obtain an annual license.</p></p>
