+<p class="faqs-heading">What are short-term or transient accommodations?</p>
+<div class="faqs-toggle-content" style="display: none;"><p><p>Accommodations provided on a daily, weekly, or monthly basis as defined in S.C. Code 1976 &amp; 12-36-920.&nbsp;&nbsp;Any stay of ninety (90) or more consecutive days in the same place is not considered a short-term accommodation.</p></p>
+</div>
